flowchart TD
  GITHUB["GitHub Workflow Plugin<br/><br/>Issue → Planning → Implementation → Pull Request → Review → Merge"]

  COMMANDS["Commands<br/><br/>Interactive entry points<br/>for user use cases"]
  AGENTS["Workflow Agents<br/><br/>Issue · Preparation<br/>Delivery · Review · Integration<br/><br/>Workflow orchestration and dialogue"]

  SKILLS["GitHub Skills<br/><br/>Issues<br/>Branches<br/>Worktrees<br/>Commits<br/>Pull Requests<br/>Reviews<br/>Merge"]

  HOOKS["Hooks<br/><br/>Status validation<br/>Safety gates"]
  RULES["GitHub Rules<br/><br/>Branch strategy<br/>Commit conventions<br/>Issue linkage<br/>Draft PR policy<br/>Merge policy<br/>Protection against destructive actions"]

  EXTERNAL["External Project Capabilities<br/><br/>TypeScript · Angular · NestJS · NX · ModernUO<br/>Architecture · Testing · Security · Documentation<br/><br/>Loaded dynamically based on project context"]

  GITHUB --> AGENTS
  COMMANDS --> AGENTS
  AGENTS --> SKILLS
  SKILLS --> HOOKS
  SKILLS --> RULES
  AGENTS -. "resolves capabilities" .-> EXTERNAL
